  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iMVXuxb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"89\"></p><p>若玩家攜帶高溫流體，將會受到灼傷。溫度閾值可進行配置，目前設定為1300º（岩漿溫度）。此功能應適用於任何編碼正確的流體容器。</p><p>支援版本：1.12、1.15.2、1.16.3、1.16.4、1.16.5 及 1.17.1。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o6kiFBd.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/discord.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"37\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4tPfwjn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"http://www.djmaclennan.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/patreon_logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/buuz135\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://cdn3.iconfinder.com/data/icons/social-icons-5/606/Twitter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Buuz135mods\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fpartners.creeper.host%252fr%252fbuuz135tlx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aCp5USH.png\" alt=\"Promo\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\"></a></p>",
